            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThe part that allows having main window at screen center is planned as part of #1343, but in a slightly different way that I fill is more useful (which is a trade secret until the release :) ). It won't allow having spare scratch buffers, though.\n\nClosing in favor of #1343.",
